{"name": "Distantia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken in a space station that feels familiar \u2013 yet something is wrong. Nothing here makes sense. Everything follows rules you don\u2019t yet understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/ecfdf3d796bf765356d719b71231aab8.poster.avif?t=1785327618\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/ecfdf3d796bf765356d719b71231aab8.webm?t=1785327618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/ecfdf3d796bf765356d719b71231aab8.mp4?t=1785327618\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this dark 2D action platformer, survival depends on what you learn. Observe your surroundings, experiment, and adapt \u2013 because knowledge is your only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master fast-paced ranged combat. Exploit enemy behaviors and discover hidden interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/0ecab6821c37cd09f70093ff9b486005.poster.avif?t=1785327618\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/0ecab6821c37cd09f70093ff9b486005.webm?t=1785327618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/0ecab6821c37cd09f70093ff9b486005.mp4?t=1785327618\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a hostile, interconnected world filled with secrets, strange entities, and fragments of a larger mystery. Every discovery expands your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use what you learn. Push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/8acf9794dbf4fe0df4fd0ff07d20be3b.poster.avif?t=1785327618\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/8acf9794dbf4fe0df4fd0ff07d20be3b.webm?t=1785327618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/extras/8acf9794dbf4fe0df4fd0ff07d20be3b.mp4?t=1785327618\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A dark 2D action platformer where exploration is key. Every discovery becomes a tool. Every mistake, a lesson. Learn the hidden rules of this place where you are trapped. Adapt to deadly encounters and master fast-paced combat to uncover what lies beneath the surface.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280370/590c1e0c06777ab8febb1b77e96048a42b83f1f6/header.jpg?t=1785327618", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Exploration", "Action", "Story Rich", "Shooter", "Mystery"], "developers": "Max H", "publishers": "Max H", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4280370", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/1HekguEev3o", "first_seen": 1785276000.0, "review_rank": 191}